    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/ac6c10fa550c2d654d0881c4863707d0.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=318 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S A RITE OF PASSAGE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate built-for-VR magical combat experience where each battle is a test of skill, magical creativity, and perseverance, from the veteran indie studio behind FORM and Twilight Path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for those who crave intense combat and relentless real-world physical gameplay. Every spell, every motion, every decision will mean the difference between victory and another hard-earned lesson. Prepare to die\u2026a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/6d21beefbe62944898399d8516788f5c.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/6d21beefbe62944898399d8516788f5c.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS YOUR WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of <strong>HexTime</strong> to outmaneuver your enemies. Slow down the chaos around you, anticipate attacks, and strike with unparalleled precision. Time manipulation isn\u2019t just a feature\u2014it\u2019s your key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE ALL THE POWER YOU NEED...BUT CAN YOU WIELD IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019ll take more than a few button presses to face a dozen axes hurtling toward your head..and come out breathing. In HexWind you ARE a master of the elements - but can you master your own physical limitations to fully step into your avatar\u2019s shoes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLESH MAGICAL MAYHEM TO AN ORIGINAL HEAVY METAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch that perfect combat rhythm as you lay waste to hordes of enemies to the adrenaline-pumping beats of an original Metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.mp4?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK YOU CAN SURVIVE THE CHAOS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HexWind, survival isn\u2019t guaranteed\u2014it\u2019s earned. Dive into an ethereal dimension of chaos and metal, and flex every magical muscle to battle your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the HexWind community and Shape the Journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of the HexWind story! We have\u00a0<strong>regular updates</strong>\u00a0planned, packed with new content, features, and enhancements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out our<strong>\u00a0development roadmap</strong>,\u00a0laying out our ambitious plan to expand the game\u2019s world, abilities, and challenges\u2014all influenced by feedback from players like you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Content Drops</strong>: New spells, procedurally generated environments, enemies, collectibles and dungeons to keep the adventure fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong>: Your feedback directly impacts game improvements and additions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Insider program</strong>: Get sneak peeks at upcoming features and participate in special events.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you battle your way out of this arcane world?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.mp4?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/ac6c10fa550c2d654d0881c4863707d0.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=318 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S A RITE OF PASSAGE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate built-for-VR magical combat experience where each battle is a test of skill, magical creativity, and perseverance, from the veteran indie studio behind FORM and Twilight Path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for those who crave intense combat and relentless real-world physical gameplay. Every spell, every motion, every decision will mean the difference between victory and another hard-earned lesson. Prepare to die\u2026a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/6d21beefbe62944898399d8516788f5c.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/6d21beefbe62944898399d8516788f5c.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS YOUR WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of <strong>HexTime</strong> to outmaneuver your enemies. Slow down the chaos around you, anticipate attacks, and strike with unparalleled precision. Time manipulation isn\u2019t just a feature\u2014it\u2019s your key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE ALL THE POWER YOU NEED...BUT CAN YOU WIELD IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019ll take more than a few button presses to face a dozen axes hurtling toward your head..and come out breathing. In HexWind you ARE a master of the elements - but can you master your own physical limitations to fully step into your avatar\u2019s shoes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLESH MAGICAL MAYHEM TO AN ORIGINAL HEAVY METAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch that perfect combat rhythm as you lay waste to hordes of enemies to the adrenaline-pumping beats of an original Metal soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/de0a7ae3f403ee56d264ac5aad3fd76a.mp4?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINK YOU CAN SURVIVE THE CHAOS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HexWind, survival isn\u2019t guaranteed\u2014it\u2019s earned. Dive into an ethereal dimension of chaos and metal, and flex every magical muscle to battle your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the HexWind community and Shape the Journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of the HexWind story! We have\u00a0<strong>regular updates</strong>\u00a0planned, packed with new content, features, and enhancements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out our<strong>\u00a0development roadmap</strong>,\u00a0laying out our ambitious plan to expand the game\u2019s world, abilities, and challenges\u2014all influenced by feedback from players like you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Content Drops</strong>: New spells, procedurally generated environments, enemies, collectibles and dungeons to keep the adventure fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong>: Your feedback directly impacts game improvements and additions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Insider program</strong>: Get sneak peeks at upcoming features and participate in special events.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you battle your way out of this arcane world?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.poster.avif?t=1749836708\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.webm?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739340/extras/c800171bf6322abd666b745ade4f5e4e.mp4?t=1749836708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
